Compile if PLAINSPEAK is defined:
    Say "plainspeak".
End compile if.
Compile if __STDC_HOSTED__ is defined:
    Say "hosted".
End compile if.
Compile if __STDC_VERSION__ is defined:
    Say "versioned".
End compile if.
Compile if NOT_PREDEFINED is defined:
    Say "wrong".
Otherwise:
    Say "undefined".
End compile if.
